<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GLOOMY SURROUNDINGS.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Clouds overhead and dirty snow underfoot. The game's locations reflect the realities of provincial post-CIS cities. Our story begins in one of them. Not the most cheerful landscape, is it? <br><strong>Every</strong> scene is inspired by real-life streets.  </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >GAME FEATURES:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A unique visual style done in the \u201cdirty\u201d shades of a winter city.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Melancholic and gloomy soundtrack, in the genres of Dark Ambient, Post-punk and Witch House. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>4k</strong> artwork. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Locations tell their <strong>own story</strong>, just look closely. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An environment that changes depending on &quot;darkness&quot; scale.  </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tons of undertone for the riddle enjoyers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >New <u><strong>content</strong></u> on re-runs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593\u2593</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can steal beer and smoke cigarettes! Lots of cigarettes!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art. <strong>No AI</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul>","developers":["MAT Affect"],"dlc":[4205770,4205890],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2566880/c4b54403bd7689ab92310c5d014eba3af1e768ba/header.jpg?t=1765008052","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2566880/850464/0363b8fb6e2fd27bbdddcb1e966a98966a4b81be/1750932079